{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40495","headline":"及第勅下宴中献座主杜侍郎 · 曹松","name":"及第勅下宴中献座主杜侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得召丘墙泪却频，若无公道也无因。\n门前送勅朱衣吏，席上衔杯碧落人。\n半夜笙歌教泥月，平明桃杏放烧春。\n南山虽有归溪路，争那酬恩未杀身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}